---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updatedDate = '1 January 2025'; // TODO: Update when Privacy Policy is finalised
---

<BaseLayout
 title="Privacy Policy"
 description="Limber privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
 noindex={true}
>
 <section class="bg-limber-green py-24 lg:py-36 border-b-2 border-limber-vibe">
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="stacked-heading mb-4">
      <span class="font-headline uppercase text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-limber-vibe block leading-none -mb-1">privacy</span>
      <span class="font-display italic font-medium text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-limber-cream block leading-none">Policy</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-limber-cream/50">Last updated: {updatedDate}</p>
  </div>
 </section>

 <section class="py-16 bg-limber-cream-bg">
 <div class=" px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <!--
 TODO: Replace all sections below with your actual Privacy Policy.
 Australian businesses must comply with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the
 Australian Privacy Principles (APPs). We recommend legal review before publishing.
 -->

 <div class="space-y-10 font-sans text-sm text-limber-brown/80 leading-relaxed">

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">1. About This Policy</h2>
 <p>
 Limber ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your privacy in accordance with the
 Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles. This policy explains how we
 collect, use, and disclose personal information.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
 <p>We may collect the following types of personal information:</p>
 <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
 <li>Name, email address, phone number, and postal address</li>
 <li>Health information relevant to your participation in classes</li>
 <li>Payment information (processed securely via our payment provider)</li>
 <li>Class booking history and membership details</li>
 <li>Website usage data via analytics tools</li>
 </ul>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
 <p>We use your personal information to:</p>
 <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
 <li>Process bookings and membership payments</li>
 <li>Communicate with you about your bookings and our services</li>
 <li>Send you marketing communications (where you have opted in)</li>
 <li>Improve our website and services</li>
 <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
 </ul>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">4. Disclosure of Information</h2>
 <p>
 We do not sell your personal information. We may share your information with third-party
 service providers who assist in operating our business (e.g. Momence for booking management,
 payment processors), subject to confidentiality obligations.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">5. Data Security</h2>
 <p>
 We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information from misuse, interference, loss,
 and unauthorised access. Payment information is processed via [payment provider] and is not
 stored on our servers.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">6. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
 <p>
 Our website uses cookies and analytics tools to understand how visitors use the site. You can
 disable cookies in your browser settings, though this may affect some site functionality.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">7. Access &amp; Correction</h2>
 <p>
 You have the right to access and correct personal information we hold about you. To make a
 request, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@limberco.com.au" class="text-limber-tericotta hover:underline">hello@limberco.com.au</a>.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">8. Marketing Communications</h2>
 <p>
 You may opt out of marketing emails at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in any email
 we send, or by emailing us directly.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
 <p>
 We may update this policy from time to time. The current version will always be available on
 this page.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="font-headline text-base text-limber-green mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
 <p>
 Privacy questions or complaints? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@limberco.com.au" class="text-limber-tericotta hover:underline">hello@limberco.com.au</a>.
 </p>
 </div>

 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
</BaseLayout>
